cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "transferegovpy: Access the TransfereGov open data APIs from Python"
abstract: >-
  A Python client for the three open data APIs of TransfereGov, the Brazilian
  federal government's platform for transfers to states, municipalities and
  civil society: special transfers, fund-to-fund transfers and decentralized
  credit. Returns typed pandas DataFrames, with pagination, throttling, retries
  and an optional response cache.
